NOTE ON THE DICTIONARY DATA

The MIT license above covers this repository in full — both the code and the
dictionary data (artist entries, biographies, aliases, connectors, and
sub-category metadata) under `src/pillars/`, `src/aliasMap.ts`,
`src/connectors.ts`, and `src/subCategoryMeta.ts`.

The biographies were generated with large language models (Claude and Gemini)
under human review, and are released under the same terms. Artist names, genre
labels, and the factual associations between them are not claimed as property
— they are facts. Attribution is appreciated but, per MIT, required only in the
form of this notice.
